{"id":274,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自学自習と自治自律の成城学園中高","feature_description":"「自学自習」と「自治自律」を核に、質の高い学び、多様な体験、心身の鍛錬を通して個性を磨く学校です。めざす姿、学校紹介、特色ある教育活動、部活動が整理され、自然体験や選択授業などの学校生活も見通しやすい構成です。自然体験や選択授業、課外活動も並び、学びと生活の両面を比較しやすい学校です。自然体験や選択授業、課外活動も並び、学びと生活の両面を比較しやすい学校です。","clubs":[{"id":4082,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4083,"name":"女子サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4084,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4085,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4086,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4087,"name":"男子テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4088,"name":"女子テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4089,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4090,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4091,"name":"男子ホッケー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4092,"name":"女子ホッケー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4093,"name":"チアダンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/